  "definition_history": "The72-target named-mode plan predates solving. Spectral comparison was added after partial results exposed energy-based label ambiguity; all original named-mode results and the50%-strain-energy rule are retained separately. This is an explicit comparison-method/scope change, not a production solver correction. No nearest-target reassignment or best-of-mesh selection.",
  "overlap_policy": "Primary frequency sets, named-mode checks, workbook/CSV alternatives and the older3749-slot native archive overlap and must not be combined. All unavailable archive values remain in their old denominator. The two-state low-inertia diagnostic is a modified input and adds no primary passes.",
  "qualifications": [
    "Original operating-mode startup and missing W0 input identity remain unresolved.",
    "Paper/source mass-position conflicts remain in the72-target scope; no positions or frequencies are silently corrected.",
    "Both mesh eigenvectors must match, but nativeASWING eigenvectors are unavailable; source bending/torsion labels are not validated by a spectral match.",
    "The secondary named-mode rule is provisional for strongly mixed modes and retains its original unpassed results.",
    "No experimental, airflow, flutter, complete-spectrum or full-family validation claim."
  ],
